；下有三星銳，曰罰，爲斬艾事；其外四星，左右肩、股也。參，所今翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"孛，蒲内翻。天文志：参为白虎，三星直者是为衡石；下有三星锐，曰罚，为斩艾事；其外四星，左右肩、股也。参，所今翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"91590393-db0e-11ef-ad5c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3夏，四月，有星孛于參。","content_fanyi":"夏季四月，有孛星出现在参宿旁边。","content_jianti_auto":"3夏，四月，有星孛于参。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2226,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"91590392-db0e-11ef-a61d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91590397-db0e-11ef-b677-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：不得日日宰殺。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：不得日日宰杀。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"91590396-db0e-11ef-873d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91590399-db0e-11ef-b798-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：食具也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：食具也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"91590398-db0e-11ef-94dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9159039b-db0e-11ef-b0d8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：秣，養馬以粟秣食之也。正事，謂駕供祭祀、蒐狩之事，非游田者也。乘，繩證翻。秣，音末。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：秣，养马以粟秣食之也。正事，谓驾供祭祀、搜狩之事，非游田者也。乘，绳证翻。秣，音末。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"9159039a-db0e-11ef-87ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":14,"source_start_index":3,"source_text":"見二十一卷武帝元封三年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"902a2a4c-db0e-11ef-b130-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9159039d-db0e-11ef-a99f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"角抵，見二十一卷武帝元封三年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"角抵，见二十一卷武帝元封三年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"9159039c-db0e-11ef-bd0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李斐","people_name_jianti_auto":"李斐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9159039f-db0e-11ef-bd4a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉灼","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋灼","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"915903a0-db0e-11ef-b5fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦始皇","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦始皇","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"915903a1-db0e-11ef-9c94-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"915903a2-db0e-11ef-8dbd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"915903a3-db0e-11ef-919f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"酈道元","people_name_jianti_auto":"郦道元","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"915903a4-db0e-11ef-9fb3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"915903a5-db0e-11ef-98fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陽山","place_name_jianti_auto":"阳山","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"915903a6-db0e-11ef-b5cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北假","place_name_jianti_auto":"北假","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"915903a7-db0e-11ef-8a96-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"五原","place_name_jianti_auto":"五原","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"915903a8-db0e-11ef-a699-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北假","place_name_jianti_auto":"北假","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"915903a9-db0e-11ef-a49d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北假","place_name_jianti_auto":"北假","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"915903aa-db0e-11ef-901f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高闕","place_name_jianti_auto":"高阙","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"915903ab-db0e-11ef-b6b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"915903ac-db0e-11ef-a6ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陽山","place_name_jianti_auto":"阳山","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"915903ad-db0e-11ef-a21f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北假","place_name_jianti_auto":"北假","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"915903ae-db0e-11ef-811b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"李斐曰：主假賃見官田與民，收其假稅也，故置田農之官。晉灼曰：匈奴傳：秦始皇渡河，據陽山、北假中。王莽傳：五原、北假，膏壤殖穀。北假，地名。師古曰：晉說是也。酈道元曰：自高闕以東，夾山帶河，陽山以西，皆北假也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"李斐曰：主假赁见官田与民，收其假税也，故置田农之官。晋灼曰：匈奴传：秦始皇渡河，据阳山、北假中。王莽传：五原、北假，膏壤殖谷。北假，地名。师古曰：晋说是也。郦道元曰：自高阙以东，夹山带河，阳山以西，皆北假也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"9159039e-db0e-11ef-ba20-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"915903b2-db0e-11ef-8b32-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宣帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"宣帝","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"915903b3-db0e-11ef-a075-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"武帝置鹽鐵官。宣帝置常平倉。","note_content_jianti_auto":"武帝置盐铁官。宣帝置常平仓。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"915903b1-db0e-11ef-9f5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"915903b5-db0e-11ef-ac06-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭帝","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"915903b6-db0e-11ef-81eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宣帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"宣帝","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"915903b7-db0e-11ef-8220-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"武帝爲博士官置弟子五十人。昭帝增弟子員滿百人。宣帝末，增倍之。令今不限員數以廣學者。後數年，以用度不足，更爲設員千人。","note_content_jianti_auto":"武帝为博士官置弟子五十人。昭帝增弟子员满百人。宣帝末，增倍之。令今不限员数以广学者。后数年，以用度不足，更为设员千人。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"915903b4-db0e-11ef-bd30-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"宫廷事务","official_name":"太官","official_note":"太官是汉代掌管宫廷膳食的官职，属于少府系统，负责皇帝和宫廷的饮食供应。在上下文中，诏令太官减少每日宰杀牲畜，体现了汉元帝采纳儒家建议、提倡节俭的政策。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"詔太官毋日殺","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"7e4c9dd5-29ed-4a72-bc63-66743ba6616d"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"财政","official_name":"齊三服官","official_note":"齊三服官是汉代在齐地设立的官职，负责管理宫廷服饰的生产和供应，属于财政和宫廷事务的一部分。在上下文中，罢免此官是汉元帝精简机构、减少奢侈开支的措施之一。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"罷角抵、上林宮館希御幸者、齊三服官、北假田官、鹽鐵官、常平倉","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"4ef3e94f-2275-44e6-94a4-ac29e36427d6"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"北假田官","official_note":"北假田官是汉代在北方边境地区设立的官职，负责管理屯田和农业事务，以支持边防。在上下文中，罢免此官可能是为了减少行政开支或调整边境政策。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"罷角抵、上林宮館希御幸者、齊三服官、北假田官、鹽鐵官、常平倉","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"1510697d-c07a-405b-8185-f313985de7c6"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"财政","official_name":"鹽鐵官","official_note":"鹽鐵官是汉代负责盐铁专卖和税收的官职，属于财政系统，对国家的经济收入有重要影响。在上下文中，罢免此官是汉元帝改革经济政策、可能放松国家控制的一部分。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"罷角抵、上林宮館希御幸者、齊三服官、北假田官、鹽鐵官、常平倉","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"3f89bea9-7b49-43b7-8a98-f592cf946906"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"博士弟子","official_note":"博士弟子是汉代太学中的学生，由博士官教导，学习儒家经典，属于文教系统。在上下文中，取消博士弟子的名额限制是为了扩大教育机会，鼓励学术发展。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"博士弟子毋置員","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"a0ba7901-c752-498f-b98c-2975ff5f7ab2"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-124,"link_death_year":-44,"link_td_description":"贡禹，西汉中期大臣。字少翁，琅琊郡（今山东诸城）人。他在汉宣帝时，任谏大夫。他多次上书汉元帝，针对朝廷腐败、贵族奢侈、郡县人民贫困，建议皇帝选贤任能、诛杀奸臣，重视节俭、减轻徭役。初元五年（前44年）六月，代陈万年为御史大夫，十二月去世，薛广德继任。","link_td_id":"Q10013054","link_td_number_id":1551696,"people_name":"貢禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"贡禹","people_xingming":"贡禹","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"915903b9-db0e-11ef-ab85-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"上林","place_name_jianti_auto":"上林","resolved_place_entity_id":1226,"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"915903ba-db0e-11ef-a068-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","resolved_place_entity_id":25,"start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"915903bb-db0e-11ef-8496-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北假","place_name_jianti_auto":"北假","resolved_place_entity_id":4307,"start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"915903bc-db0e-11ef-9343-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4上用諸儒貢禹等之言，詔太官毋日殺，所具各減半；乘輿秣馬，無乏正事而已。罷角抵、上林宮館希御幸者、齊三服官、北假田官、鹽鐵官、常平倉。博士弟子毋置員，以廣學者；令民有能通一經者，皆復。省刑罰七十餘事。","content_fanyi":"汉元帝采纳众儒生及贡禹等人的建议，下诏命太官不得每天宰杀牲畜，所备办的膳食菜肴一律减半；皇帝乘用的车马，只要能够供应巡狩、祭祀等正事即可。取消角抵杂技，放归上林苑离宫中很少被皇帝临幸的宫女，撤销齐地三服官、北假田官、盐铁官和常平仓。博士弟子的员额不再限定，以便广增学者；下令百姓中凡能通晓一经以上者，都免除赋税徭役。又减省刑法，删去七十多条刑法案例。","content_jianti_auto":"4上用诸儒贡禹等之言，诏太官毋日杀，所具各减半；乘舆秣马，无乏正事而已。罢角抵、上林宫馆希御幸者、齐三服官、北假田官、盐铁官、常平仓。博士弟子毋置员，以广学者；令民有能通一经者，皆复。省刑罚七十余事。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2227,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"91590395-db0e-11ef-b734-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"宫廷事务","official_name":"長信少府","official_note":"長信少府是漢代官職，負責長信宮（太后居所）的事務，屬於宮廷內官。在《資治通鑑》此段中，貢禹從長信少府升任御史大夫，顯示其職位變遷。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"長信少府貢禹爲御史大夫","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"e998ee9b-1c1c-41a2-9970-1d1e1b4176af"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史大夫","official_note":"御史大夫是漢代高級官職，負責監察百官，位列三公之一。在《資治通鑑》此段中，貢禹被任命為御史大夫，反映其晉升和朝廷對其的信任。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"長信少府貢禹爲御史大夫","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"cf4f818f-2cc8-457d-bf77-c575b5c712f0"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-44,"link_td_description":"陈万年，字幼公，西汉沛郡相县（今安徽省淮北市相山区）人，平居操守清廉，处事公平，但同时他亦善于钻营，攀附许氏、史氏等外戚权贵。汉宣帝年间，受丞相邴吉的举荐而成为御史大夫。","link_td_id":"Q10016443","link_td_number_id":3816897,"people_name":"陳萬年","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈万年","people_xingming":"陈万年","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"915903bf-db0e-11ef-bbdc-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-124,"link_death_year":-44,"link_td_description":"贡禹，西汉中期大臣。字少翁，琅琊郡（今山东诸城）人。他在汉宣帝时，任谏大夫。他多次上书汉元帝，针对朝廷腐败、贵族奢侈、郡县人民贫困，建议皇帝选贤任能、诛杀奸臣，重视节俭、减轻徭役。初元五年（前44年）六月，代陈万年为御史大夫，十二月去世，薛广德继任。","link_td_id":"Q10013054","link_td_number_id":1551696,"people_name":"貢禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"贡禹","people_xingming":"贡禹","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"915903c0-db0e-11ef-9a5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-124,"link_death_year":-44,"link_td_description":"贡禹，西汉中期大臣。字少翁，琅琊郡（今山东诸城）人。他在汉宣帝时，任谏大夫。他多次上书汉元帝，针对朝廷腐败、贵族奢侈、郡县人民贫困，建议皇帝选贤任能、诛杀奸臣，重视节俭、减轻徭役。初元五年（前44年）六月，代陈万年为御史大夫，十二月去世，薛广德继任。","link_td_id":"Q10013054","link_td_number_id":1551696,"people_name":"禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"禹","people_xingming":"贡禹","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"915903c1-db0e-11ef-9a22-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長信","place_name_jianti_auto":"长信","resolved_place_entity_id":1961,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"915903c2-db0e-11ef-b761-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/贡薛韦匡","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。”正在望之死后也。","context_before":"...之。《班史》隐而不论，唯于《石显传》云：“贡禹明经著节，","source_end_index":370,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"93aa5908-5206-48d7-b35d-cd11300e359b","source_start_index":343,"source_text":"显使人致意，深自结纳。因荐禹天子，历位九卿，至御史大夫"}],"path":"续笔/卷九/贡薛韦匡","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/贡禹朱晖晚达","excerpts":[{"context_after":"杜子美云：“长安卿相多少年，富贵应须致身早。”是不然也。...","context_before":"贡禹壮年仕不遇，弃官而归。","source_end_index":89,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cdb98e12-9031-4de0-9713-0b5b93b65732","source_start_index":13,"source_text":"至元帝初，乃召用，由谏大夫迁光禄，奏言：“臣犬马之齿八十一，凡有一子，年十二。”则禹入朝时，盖年八十，其生子时固已七十岁矣，竟再迁至御史大夫，列于三公。"}],"path":"五笔/卷七/贡禹朱晖晚达","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"5陳萬年卒。六月，辛酉，長信少府貢禹爲御史大夫。禹前後言得失書數十上，上嘉其質直，多采用之。","content_fanyi":"御史大夫陈万年去世。六月二十日，辛酉，任命长信少府贡禹为御史大夫。贡禹先后呈上数十篇奏书，陈述治理措施的得失，汉元帝赞赏他坦率正直，大多采纳了他的建议。","content_jianti_auto":"5陈万年卒。六月，辛酉，长信少府贡禹为御史大夫。禹前后言得失书数十上，上嘉其质直，多采用之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2228,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"915903bd-db0e-11ef-baf5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否冒险将郅支单于侍子送至王庭","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_915903C3DB0E11EFB273A0D3651F611F_02"},{"decision_name":"如何处置到来的汉使谷吉","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_915903C3DB0E11EFB273A0D3651F611F_04"},{"decision_name":"是否接受康居邀请并迁往西部","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_915903C3DB0E11EFB